            "review_text": "Stingrui11\nSingapore, Singapore121 contributions\n0\nGood value for buffet\nMay 2018 • Friends\nFirst time eating Gyu-kaku in hanoi. We went for the second buffet menu. The quality of the meat was decent, but the staff seems quite unfamiliar with our requests (probably due to language barrier as well) and ended up giving us big portions for the first 2 cuts that we ordered which made us too full to try out other cuts.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 2, 2018",
